   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking for clarification",
     "texto": [
      "**Kan du si det en gang til?** («Can you say it again?») and **Kan du forklare det?** («Can you explain it?») are common requests. **Langsomt** means «slowly» and **tydelig** means «clearly».",
      "If you don't understand a word, you can ask **Hva betyr …?** («What does … mean?») or ask the person to say it another way: **Kan du omformulere?**"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Explaining a simple opinion",
     "texto": [
      "**Jeg mener at …** means «I think that…». After **at**, **ikke** comes before **er**: **Jeg mener at oppgaven ikke er vanskelig**. In English, «not» comes after the verb: «the task is not difficult»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
